      "value": "@{62233af8acc9d02324587ab2|full_name}\n\nI said I’d flip the video too… but I was worried, so I went ahead and checked.\n\nThese three images are all screenshots from OBS.\n\n(In other words, this is exactly how the video will be recorded and streamed.)\n\nThe first image shows the normal view, looking at the mirror.\n\nThe second image shows the view after using the flip button to face myself.\n\n(This is exactly the situation we’re discussing here on Canny.)\n\nThe third image shows the camera in flying mode, panning to face myself.\n\nI think you can clearly see that the left and right sides are reversed in the second and third images.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
